  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to manufacture ready to wear clothing for men, women and children through purchasing equipment and renting space to set up a factory. In addition to making and selling clothing, the project also seeks to train and employ individuals, especially women living with disabilities, in cutting and sewing.</narrative>
